Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 17:42:55 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] fix(agent): compose runnable ComputerUse below TUI for Stage
 A

Wire observe/execute in computer_use_substrate at composition; advertise
READY only when runnable. Surface composition diagnostics; keep
prerequisite-resolution failure distinct from USER_DECLINED.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
